            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng hải sản Tôn Lê",
            "review_text": "Mashajo\nKaliningrad, Russia11599 contributions\n26\nShells by the sea\nJul 2025 • Solo\nI was nearby and I thought I'd find somewhere to eat. Found this place on the maps, the reviews seemed normal, so I stopped by. The restaurant is located by the coast, quite large, with two floors. The setting is simple, I sat down on the ground floor. Of the staff, only one waiter spoke English, but that did not cause problems. Seafood is on the menu and there are aquariums at the entrance, but the choice was small. I ordered boiled shells and snails. Food was brought in quickly. The shells and snails were delicious, especially liked the broth - fragrant and rich. Service is quick, unobtrusive. In general, for a simple lunch near the coast - quite normal option.\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten December 8, 2025",
